    "srt_text": "1\n00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,240\nDeep in the green countryside, a giant egg finally cracked open.\n\n2\n00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:15,840\nOut tumbled a big, clumsy, grey duckling.\n\n3\n00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:20,920\nThe other farm animals laughed at him.\n\n4\n00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:26,600\nThey called him ugly and chased him away.\n\n5\n00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:36,240\nFeeling very lonely, the poor duckling ran away into the wild marsh.\n\n6\n00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:44,360\nWinter came with biting winds and deep, heavy snow.\n\n7\n00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:52,160\nThe shivering duckling hid all alone under a frozen log.\n\n8\n00:00:53,160 --> 00:01:00,200\nAt last, the warm spring sun began to melt the ice.\n\n9\n00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:11,760\nHe saw three beautiful, elegant white swans gliding gracefully across the pond.\n\n10\n00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:23,320\nThe duckling swam toward them, bowing his head in sadness.\n\n11\n00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:30,520\nBut in the clear water, he saw his own reflection.\n\n12\n00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:41,320\nHe was no longer a clumsy, dark grey bird.\n\n13\n00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:50,200\nHe had grown into a beautiful, magnificent white swan!\n\n14\n00:01:50,600 --> 00:02:01,800\nWith a joyful heart, he flapped his strong wings and flew into the bright blue sky.\n"
